進退之計！且天子幽逼，社稷危殆，四海臣子，肝腦塗地，嶠等與公並受國恩，是致命之日，事若克濟，則臣主同祚，如其不捷，身雖灰滅，不足以謝責於先帝。今之事勢，義無旋踵，騎猛獸，安可中下哉！公若違眾獨反，人心必沮。沮眾敗事，義旗將廻指於公矣。」侃無以對，遂留不去。","raw_start":4831,"raw_end":5263,"raw_line":54},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-wenqiao"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632","source":{"title":"晉書卷六十六·陶侃","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1527632","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1527632","revision_id":1527632,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-22","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"晉書卷六十六·陶侃","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","raw_path":"source-evidence/jin066-roll/ws1527632.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"6cddc694d426567aad52b2183afd501d71adab778675ef7b91850801a4ced3aa","collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin066-roll/volume-reading.json"]}},{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-wenqiao","source":{"title":"晉書卷六十七","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2592755","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2592755","revision_id":2592755,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","extent":"固定數位原題「溫嶠」題下全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫固定修訂2592755","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2592755-raw.wikitext","wikitext_sha256":"bfbb80734b71669aaed368f54f088c89285f1acdbe70ca678745ea9684029495","raw_file_sha256":"bfbb80734b71669aaed368f54f088c89285f1acdbe70ca678745ea9684029495","collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin067-wen-children/reading.json","sou